Ocean's Eight (stylized as Ocean's 8) is a 2018 American heist comedy film
directed by Gary Ross and written by Ross and Olivia Milch.

11
01:01:03,000 --> 01:01:09,000
A spin-off of Steven Soderbergh's Ocean's trilogy, it is the
fourth installment in the Ocean's franchise.

12
01:06:36,000 --> 01:06:42,000
The film features an ensemble cast including Sandra Bullock, Cate Blanchett, Anne Hathaway,
Mindy Kaling, Sarah Paulson, Awkwafina, Rihanna, and Helena Bonham Carter.

13
01:12:09,000 --> 01:12:15,000
The plot follows Debbie Ocean, the sister of Danny Ocean, who assembles a team of women to orchestrate an
elaborate heist at the annual Met Gala at the Metropolitan Museum of Art in New York City.

14
01:17:42,000 --> 01:17:48,000
The film premiered at Alice Tully Hall on June 5, 2018, and was released
theatrically in the United States on June 8, 2018, by Warner Bros.

15
01:23:15,000 --> 01:23:21,000
Pictures—exactly eleven years after the release of Ocean's Thirteen (2007).

16
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:54,000
It received generally positive reviews from critics, who
praised the ensemble cast and stylish direction.

17
01:34:21,000 --> 01:34:27,000
A commercial success, the film grossed $298 million worldwide
against a production budget of approximately $70 million.

